WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
The prerequisite medium bomb is lit beside Ryu.

2
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:01.750
Ryu guards the medium target.

3
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.150
Sprint slide hits after the blocked target.

4
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:02.850
The existing bomb launches Ryu.

5
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.200
Sprint launcher extends the bomb hit.

6
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.150
The OD air grab catches the launch.

7
00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:06.950
Another Sprint launcher extends the rebound.

8
00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:07.550
Heavy bomb plant spends one additional can.

9
00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:08.000
Ryu rises beside the new heavy bomb.
